{"id":"00290","root":"uni00290_1","name":{"ja":"八津　紫","en":"Yatsu Murasaki"},"title":{"ja":"【淡き若紫】","en":"【Tender Young Murasaki】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【淡き若紫】 八津　紫","en":"【Tender Young Murasaki】 Yatsu Murasaki"},"element":"Superhuman","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Undead","Taimanin"],"release":"2020-01-31","limited":false,"characterId":17,"profile":{"ja":"主人公の家に居候中の若いさくらと同じ次元に存在する『若い紫』。さくらと同じく学生で、五車学園で生徒会長を務める。忽然と消えてしまったさくらの事を調査していて、次元侵略者ブレインフレーヤーの仕業であることを突き止め、ブレインフレーヤーを探している。大人の紫に比べるとやや生硬で杓子定規過ぎるきらいはあるが、冷静沈着で質実剛健、意外と面倒見がよく優しいが理解されにくい所や、大好きな『アサギお姉さまの匂いを嗅いで「はあはあ」する』趣味は変わらない。","en":"Yatsu Murasaki is a \"young Purple\" who exists in the same dimension as the Sakura staying at the protagonist's house. Like Sakura, she's a student and serves as student council president at Gosha Academy. While investigating Sakura's sudden disappearance, she uncovered that it was the work of the dimensional invader Brainlayer and is now hunting the Brainlayer. Compared to the adult Purple, she can be a bit stiff and overly by-the-book, but she is calm, pragmatic, sturdy, surprisingly caring, and kind—though often misunderstood. Her favorite hobby remains unchanged: sniffing \"big sister Asagi's scent and going 'haa haa.'\""},"illustrator":"カガミ","voiceActor":"水瀬沙季","forms":[{"id":"uni00290_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1266,2532],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[197,394],"def":[102,204],"spd":[69,69],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["1","470004"]},{"id":"uni00290_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1932,3864],"sp":[230,230],"atk":[319,638],"def":[129,258],"spd":[69,69],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["1","470004","470005"]},{"id":"uni00290_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","levelMax":100,"stats":{"hp":[2598,5201],"sp":[330,330],"atk":[441,881],"def":[156,313],"spd":[69,69],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["1","470004","470005","470006"]}],"skills":{"1":{"slot":"attack","id":1,"name":null,"hits":1,"